    "probe_text": "I've traced the full request-handling chain. Here is the complete ordered list.\n\n## Where the logic lives\n\n`POST /api/owners` is mapped on the generated `OwnersApi` interface (`@Valid @RequestBody OwnerFieldsDto`, `consumes/produces application/json`) and implemented by `OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner` (`src/main/java/.../rest/controller/v1/OwnerRestControllerV1.java:162-277`). The request body binds to the **`OwnerFieldsDto`** \u2014 not the `Owner` entity \u2014 so only the DTO's Bean Validation constraints fire; the `Owner` entity's own constraints (`@NotEmpty`, E.164 `@Pattern`, etc.) never run on this path.\n\nEverything below runs in exactly this order. A failure stops the chain at that point.\n\n## Phase 0 \u2014 Before the controller body\n\n1. **Method authorization** \u2014 `@PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)\")` requires role `ROLE_OWNER_ADMIN` (403 otherwise). Only enforced when `petclinic.security.enable=true`.\n2. **Bean Validation on `OwnerFieldsDto`** (via `@Valid`; failure \u2192 400 `MethodArgumentNotValidException`):\n   - `firstName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1,30)`, `@Pattern` (letters, up to 3 words w/ space/`'`/`-`)\n   - `lastName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1,30)`, `@Pattern` (same, optional trailing `.`)\n   - `city` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1,80)`\n   - `telephone` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1,20)`\n   - `title` \u2014 `@Size(1,10)`; `address` / `addressLine1` / `addressLine2` \u2014 `@Size(1,255)` each\n   - `email` \u2014 `@Size(1,255)`, `@Email`\n   - `postcode` \u2014 `@Pattern(\"^[0-9]{4}$\")`\n   - `registrationDate`, `birthDate` \u2014 `@Valid` (LocalDate)\n\n## Phase 1 \u2014 Controller body (validations, in order)\n\n3. **Idempotency short-circuit** \u2014 if an `Idempotency-Key` header was seen before, return the previously-created owner with **200 OK** (no new create). (`:168-177`)\n4. **Telephone normalization** \u2014 `normalizeTelephone(...)`; if it returns null \u2192 **400** \"The telephone number is invalid\". (`:178-181`)\n5. **Disposable email check** \u2014 `isDisposableEmailDomain(email)` \u2192 **400** \"Disposable email domains are not accepted\". (`:182-184`)\n6. **Map DTO \u2192 `Owner`** via `ownerMapper.toOwner(...)`; this triggers normalizing setters (`setAddress` normalizes/upper-cases/expands, `setEmail` lower-cases). (`:185`)\n7. **Address required** \u2014 `getAddress()` composes structured `addressLine1`(+`addressLine2`) or falls back to flat `address`; if blank \u2192 **400** \"An address must be supplied\". Composed value written back. (`:191-195`)\n8. **Postcode-vs-city** \u2014 `owner.isPostcodeValidForCity()` false \u2192 **400** \"The postcode is not valid for the city\". (`:197-199`)\n9. **Identity-duplicate check** \u2014 build `identityKey` (SHA-256 over normalizedTelephone|lowerEmail|soundex(lastName)); if any non-deleted owner matches \u2192 **409** \"An owner with the same identity already exists\". (`:213-218`)\n10. **City capacity** \u2014 `ownersInCity >= 50` \u2192 **409** \"The city has reached its owner capacity\". (`:222-225`)\n11. **Registration date not in future** \u2014 if provided date is after today \u2192 **400** \"The registration date must not be in the future\". (`:227-229`)\n12. **Daily registration limit** \u2014 after snapping to a business day, `ownersRegisteredToday >= 100` \u2192 **429** \"The daily owner registration limit has been reached\". (`:233-236`)\n\n## Phase 2 \u2014 Side-effects / derived state set on the owner (in order)\n\nComputed before persistence:\n13. `householdId` set (derived from lastName + postcode). (`:204`)\n14. `registrationDate` set to the business-day-adjusted date. (`:239`)\n15. `memberId` set. (`:240`)\n16. `namesakeCount` set (count of same first+last name). (`:241`)\n17. `bulkSignupWarning` set (true if >80 registered today). (`:237, :242`)\n18. `capacityWarning` set (true if 40\u201349 owners in city). (`:226, :243`)\n19. `householdSize` set (existing household members + 1). (`:246`)\n20. `membershipLevelCap` set \u2014 only when `sharesHousehold` is false and household non-empty (cap = max member level + 1). (`:251-257`)\n21. `possibleDuplicate` / `possibleDuplicateOf` set \u2014 soft match by Soundex(lastName)+postcode, skipped if `sharesHousehold`. (`:262-264`)\n\n## Phase 3 \u2014 Persistence and post-save side-effects (in order)\n\n22. **Persist** \u2014 `clinicService.saveOwner(owner)` \u2192 `ownerRepository.save` (its own `@Transactional`; DB-generated id). (`:265`)\n23. **Record idempotency key** \u2014 store `Idempotency-Key \u2192 owner.id` in an in-memory `ConcurrentHashMap` (process-local, not persisted). (`:266-268`)\n24. **Audit log line** \u2014 `AUDIT.info(\"owner created id=... \")`. (`:269-270`)\n25. **Structured event log** \u2014 `emitOwnerCreatedEvent(owner)` serializes an `OwnerCreatedEvent` record to JSON (schema v2, sequence-stamped) to the `AUDIT` logger. This is a **log line, not a Spring `ApplicationEvent`**. (`:271`)\n26. **Notification log line** \u2014 `NOTIFY.info(\"welcome owner ...\")` \u2014 a log line, **no actual email is sent** (no `JavaMailSender` in the project). (`:272`)\n27. **Build response** \u2014 map to `OwnerDto`, set `Location: /api/owners/{id}` header, return **201 Created**. (`:273-276`)\n\n## Notes worth flagging\n\n- **No JPA lifecycle callbacks** (`@PrePersist`/`@PostPersist`/`@EntityListeners`) exist anywhere; all derived fields are set imperatively in the controller.\n- **No password encoding** on this path \u2014 owners have no password (the `BCryptPasswordEncoder` bean is only for user auth).\n- **No custom validators** apply to owners (the `PetAgeValidator` is pet-only).\n- The controller method is **not** `@Transactional`, so each `findAllOwners()` read and the final `saveOwner` run as separate transactions \u2014 the duplicate/capacity/daily-count checks are not atomic with the insert (a TOCTOU race window exists).\n- Exceptions are rendered as RFC-7807 `ProblemDetail` by `